            "review_text": "Christopher C\n135 contributions\n1\nCooking food with no shirts on:(((\nMay 2019 • Couples\nOrdered beef noodle soup, vegetable spring rolls, and another pork dish. It was disappointing because I saw them walk around with my beef noodle soup, place it down on a mixed table near the kitchen where it sat for 10 minutes then served it to me. This place is completely unorganized. Why? They bring out one dish at one time when they should bring it all together. The male workers cook the food with no shirts on and that is unsanitary. Took 50 minutes to serve the spring rolls. \n\nThis place fools you with the pictures because the food does not match the pictures. \n\nThere are many more restaurants to choose from. I’ll be taking my money anywhere.\nRead more\nWritten May 2, 2019",
